SUMMARY:JULY Art Crawl: We tour 3 Private galleries -- St Clair West ($10 
 per person)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nThe *stars* have lined up and we will 
 continue our monthly **Art Crawls** into JULY (Visiting galleries/artist r
 un centres on **St. Clair Ave West** for the **first time** as a group)\n\
 nThese 3 spaces are 'risk takers and pushing the boundries'\n\n***Please r
 ead everything over first. $10 per person via e-transfer***\n\nSaturday JU
 LY 4th (2:00pm-3:30pm)\n\n**Note:** this is the first Saturday of JULY--pe
 rhaps a long weekend for some of you?\n\nI have space for about 12 people.
 \n\n**$10 per person.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Sent via e-transfer when you signup/
 rsvp.**\n\n***You're NOT confirmed until then.***\n\n***We will visit/tour
  3 different/new*** galleries/collectives each month (short walks between 
 each one).\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*This ART walk will be along St. Clair Ave W
 est (Dufferin area) About 1 km of walking.**\n\n\\*\\*We'll meet the Galle
 ry owners/artists/directors--who will lead us in 20 minutes of tour and co
 nversation at each stop.\n\n--NO cancellations/no refunds or any re-schedu
 ling. We go rain or shine.\n\nInterested in ART/artists--**and learning/vi
 siting the exceptional local private art galleries we have in Toronto..**\
 n\n(we've already visited/connected with 30 art galleries since January 1)
 \n\n*Saturday JULY 4th* **(2:00pm-3:30pm)**\n\nOnce I have 12 confirmation
 s from Meetup members (you)--I will email you the location/route of our AR
 T Crawl!! Next week.\n\n***This walk/tour will be along St Clair West (Duf
 ferin/Lansdowne) community--visiting some hidden gems! Unique spaces! Inte
 resting projects.***\n\nIf interested\, **please email me $10 when you sig
 nup.**\n\n*Include your first name only*\, and the BEST email address for 
 a reply. I will then confirm you. And confirm up our itinerary in a week o
 r so.\n\nSee you on JULY 4th! Or before.\n\n$10 per person\n\nYou can emai
 l (e-transfer) me directly here:\n\n**torontoisculture@gmail\,com**\n\nGre
 g\n\nThanks.\n\n(Possible post ART Crawl drink spot...https://truehistoryb
 eer.com/home)
