SUMMARY:Toronto Fringe Festival:  Evie  & Alfie ($19)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nCan you join us at ***FRINGE***--early
  July??\n\n# Evie & Alfie: A Very British Love Story\n\n(With TWO Internat
 ional FRINGE superstars!)\n\n$19 tickets. Details below.\n\n\\#\\#\\# June
  30\\-July 12\\\, 2026\n\nWelcome to the **38th annual Toronto Fringe Fest
 ival**\, Toronto's place for indie theatre and performance. With [123 show
 s](https://fringetoronto.com/fringe/shows) at [27 venues](https://fringeto
 ronto.com/accessibility/access-at-venues/venues) across the city!\n\nWedne
 sday July 8th (7:15pm-8:30pm)\n\n**Meet Evie & Alfie**—a retired\, quint
 essentially British couple—as they potter around their house\, drinking 
 tea\, bird spotting and reminiscing. From multiple award-winning Fringe le
 gends Alex Dallas (Horseface\, Sensible Footwear) and Jimmy Hogg (The Pota
 to King) comes a comedy full of wit\, verve and heart.\n\n“Alex Dallas a
 nd Jimmy Hogg are absolute stars. They are funny and brilliant in equal me
 asure\, an absolute joy to watch on stage. There aren’t enough superlati
 ves to describe Evie and Alfie. This is the type of show that makes Fringe
  so special” ★★★★★ -Edmonton Journal\n\nWINNER- OUTSTANDING EN
 GLISH PRODUCTION Montreal Fringe 2025\n\nAlex & Jimmy have performed at al
 l the major Fringe Festivals around the world..from\n\nEdinburgh to Adelai
 de\, USA\, Canada\n\n**Ticket link here:** (our group will attend Wednesda
 y July 8th)\n\nhttps://fringetoronto.com/fringe/show/evie-alfie-very-briti
 sh-love-story\n\nMore info on Alex--\n\nhttps://www.alexedallas.com/home
