SUMMARY:ROM:  Weston International Award Presents:  Evening with Hanif Abd
 urraqib ($20)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nAlways a HOT ticket--an important AUTH
 OR Talk. At the ROM.\n\n($15-$20 only!!)\n\nAmerican author **Hanif Abdurr
 aqib has won the 2026 Weston International Award. $75\,000**\n\n**Overview
 --**\n\nThe evening will feature Hanif Abdurraquib delivering a talk and h
 aving an in-depth conversation with an award juror & CBC.\n\nJoin us on Mo
 nday\, September 14 at the Royal Ontario Museum\, for an evening with the 
 2026 Weston International Award winner\, hosted by Ali Hassan of CBC’s C
 anada Reads.\n\n**Hanif Abdurraqib is an American memoirist and poet known
  for his distinctive style of cultural and artistic criticism through the 
 lens of music\,** **sport\, and contemporary American issues**. In a creat
 ive and wide-ranging talk\, he will bring his unique and rare intellect to
  the role of nonfiction in our society\, and his relationship to it as som
 eone from an unconventional background.\n\nHe’ll then sit down for wide-
 ranging and free-wheeling conversation with a member of the award jury and
  author Tessa McWatt. Jurors said his “work sings and stings and brings 
 truths\, both personal and communal\, as he voices culture and its complex
 ities with bold\, compassionate lyricism and a real sense of love\,” and
  that is what he will bring to the stage.\n\n***The $75\,000 prize is a co
 mpanion to the existing Hilary Weston Writers' Trust Prize for Nonfiction\
 , which is awarded annually to a Canadian author for a single work of nonf
 iction.***\n\nThe Weston International Award recognizes the career achieve
 ment of an international author for a body of nonfiction work. Eligible in
 ternational authors must have published at least three books of outstandin
 g literary merit\, in the genre of nonfiction\, that are written in Englis
 h or else widely available in translation.\n\n**Ticket link here:**\n\nhtt
 ps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/the-weston-international-award-presents-an-evenin
 g-with-hanif-abdurraqib-tickets-1983560042483?aff=oddtdtcreator\n\n**Recen
 t interview on CBC:**\n\nhttps://www.cbc.ca/books/american-author-hanif-ab
 durraqib-wins-75k-weston-international-award-for-career-achievement-in-non
 fiction-9.7235796
